# Battle 52, flown by hand at Lieutenant (Plan 31 R5): a cloaked ship (it decloaks at once) and two probes. Delegate
# wins it only by being rammed, its reactors and grid destroyed (Plan 23). Battle stations, the weapons lock, and two
# torpedoes a salvo (a tube fires all it has loaded otherwise). Target the ship once it shows (a probe till then) and
# fly at it nose on, closing to 1200-2700: the forward banks strip the shield facing us (each hit lands on the shield
# the shooter sees it by), then, with that shield under 40, torpedoes go through it and destroy it near step 200. Its
# kill list stands the battle down (step 349; the probes are left, as they are by Delegate), and the Bridge button leaves.
at 0 set power 4
at 0 set lock on
at 0 set salvo 0 2
at 0 set salvo 1 2
at 0 target 2
at 1 steer 1 1 0 1
at 20 target 1
at 45 steer 1 1 0 0
at 52 steer 0 1 0 0
at 77 steer 1 1 0 0
at 88 steer 0 1 0 0
at 107 steer 0 0 0 0
at 121 steer -1 0 0 0
at 154 steer -1 1 0 0
at 174 fire phasers
at 178 steer -1 1 0 -1
at 191 fire torpedoes
at 192 steer -1 0 0 -1
at 194 fire torpedoes
at 349 bridge
